<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>
<name>SEPLAT EHOR 2025 B and C Sectors (WGS84)</name>
<description>2025 cohort full grid, Minna/UTM 31N to WGS84 (dX=-92,dY=-93,dZ=+122). Sectors 1-18 (portions A and D): SURVEYED from the 192-point table. Sectors 19-24 (portion B, 60 ha) and 25-26 (portion C, 14 ha): COMPUTED equal-area planning grid (10-ha sectors, 1-ha subsectors) - pegs to be field-set. Sector 26 is C remainder (4 ha, 4 subsectors).</description>
